<title>ESTONIA: KALEV Q1 NET PROFIT 13 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>KALEV Q1 NET PROFIT 13 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian confectionary firm Kalev said on Monday that its net profit was 13.01 million kroons in the first quarter and 5.02 million kroons in March.  </p>
<p>Kalev made a net profit of 1.9 million kroons in February and a six million kroon profit in January this year.</p>
<p>Kalev turnover was 89 million kroons in the first quarter, the company added in its statement.</p>
<p>Assets were at 173.68 million kroons by the end of first quarter.</p>
</text>
